  "description": "*“Don’t you want to sleep with me just once?”\n\n“I guess you forgot that this is a business marriage. Or do I look cheap?”*\n\nSeol-Young was the one who brought up the subject as soon as the meeting was over. She knew that this was a political marriage. Marriage was an escape for her, and she wanted to get pregnant and see her biological mother. Beom-Hyeon, who was smoking a cigarette in the smoking room and clicking his Zippo lighter, took the cigarette out of his mouth and said, “Can’t you see this as an extension of business?”\n\n*“What kind of business do you do with sperm?”*\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated) \n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
